  data: {
    LLM: "Table Conservation. Don't play your hand cards early. Your hand is your 'Secret Weapon' because your opponent cannot see them. Use the table cards to follow suit whenever possible. If you can win a trick with a table card, do soâ€”save your hand for when you need to surprise the opponent or win a critical lead.\n\nThe 'Uncovering' Priority: Prioritize playing table cards that uncover face-down cards. The more face-up cards you have, the more flexibility you have to follow suit. If you have only one card of a suit on the table, and it's face-up, guard itâ€”if you play it and uncover a face-down card of a different suit, you might leave yourself 'Void' and vulnerable.\n\nDefensive Lead-Blocking: If you see your opponent has a King of Spades face-up on the table, and you have the Ace in your hand, don't lead Spades yourself. Wait for them to lead it, or wait until you can lead a different suit that forces them to play their King. Since there are no trumps, 'Controlling the Lead' is everything.",
    Player: "Table Conservation. Don't play your hand cards early. Your hand is your 'Secret Weapon' because your opponent cannot see them. Use the table cards to follow suit whenever possible. If you can win a trick with a table card, do soâ€”save your hand for when you need to surprise the opponent or win a critical lead.\n\nThe 'Uncovering' Priority: Prioritize playing table cards that uncover face-down cards. The more face-up cards you have, the more flexibility you have to follow suit. If you have only one card of a suit on the table, and it's face-up, guard itâ€”if you play it and uncover a face-down card of a different suit, you might leave yourself 'Void' and vulnerable.\n\nDefensive Lead-Blocking: If you see your opponent has a King of Spades face-up on the table, and you have the Ace in your hand, don't lead Spades yourself. Wait for them to lead it, or wait until you can lead a different suit that forces them to play their King. Since there are no trumps, 'Controlling the Lead' is everything.",
